$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2fdrnw  LOC_AFTER=?

* The scan loop of the fragment ` dropNum ` of TM/Prims.lean with the internal state confined to a class ` N ` : the label consumes the whole scanned word, one step per letter.  An instantiation of ~ tm2hwrd ; the class rides in the family.

